      <guid isPermaLink="false">541a7bcf9d9c11ab96250b12</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 12:52:53 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>On Bloomberg This Weekend, Bloomberg News Markets producer Anthony Stephens says Asian investors are assessing the fallout from the AI selloff as hedge funds cut exposure and uncertainty grows over US data-center policy. Speaking with hosts David Gura and Christina Ruffini, Stephens explains why the timing of AI infrastructure investment could determine the next winners and losers across technology markets. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
